msgstr "啟用服務"

msgid "Route LAN through proxy"
msgstr "LAN 透過代理"

msgid "LAN bridge to capture"
msgstr "要接管的 LAN 橋接介面"

msgid "Add an HTTPS client subscription and choose automatic or manual refresh. Saving changed settings can restart the service; routine refreshes add usable nodes to the running Xray core without restarting it."
msgstr "新增 HTTPS 用戶端訂閱並選擇自動或手動更新。儲存設定變更可能會重新啟動服務；例行更新會將可用節點加入正在執行的 Xray，無須重新啟動。"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "來源"

msgid "Subscription URL"
msgstr "訂閱網址"

msgid "HTTPS only. Keep this address private: it may contain an access token. This version supports one subscription source."
msgstr "僅支援 HTTPS。此網址可能包含存取權杖，請勿公開。此版本支援一個訂閱來源。"

msgid "Provider ID"
msgstr "供應商 ID"

msgid "Stable source identity used when reconciling renamed or updated nodes. Do not change it during a routine refresh."
msgstr "處理節點重新命名或更新時使用的固定來源識別碼。例行更新時請勿變更。"

msgid "Refresh schedule"
msgstr "更新排程"

msgid "Update method"
msgstr "更新方式"

msgid "Automatic and on request"
msgstr "自動及隨選更新"

msgid "Only on request"
msgstr "僅隨選更新"

msgid "Automatic interval (seconds)"
msgstr "自動更新間隔（秒）"

msgid "Maximum imported nodes"
msgstr "最多匯入節點數"

msgid "Update now"
msgstr "立即更新"

msgid "Request subscription refresh"
msgstr "要求更新訂閱"

msgid "First save and apply any changed settings. This button queues a refresh; check the journal for its result."
msgstr "請先儲存並套用變更。此按鈕會將更新要求加入佇列；請在日誌中查看結果。"

msgid "Refresh request failed."
msgstr "更新要求失敗。"

msgid "Refresh requested. The previous route remains active until the new catalog is validated and published."
msgstr "已要求更新。新目錄驗證並發布前，原路由繼續生效。"

msgid "Route lists for devices"
msgstr "裝置路由清單"

msgid "Each route list selects locations and a failover mode for its client IP addresses. The first list is the default for unmatched devices. Changing route lists changes Xray routing configuration and requires a service restart when applied."
msgstr "每個路由清單為其用戶端 IP 選擇位置和容錯移轉模式。首個清單用於未符合條件的裝置。套用路由清單變更會修改 Xray 路由設定並重新啟動服務。"

msgid "Create up to eight lists. Put more specific device rules before broader subnets. An empty location selection fails closed."
msgstr "最多建立八個清單。特定裝置規則應排在較廣泛的子網路之前。未選位置時將封鎖連線。"

msgid "Servers and mode"
msgstr "伺服器與模式"

msgid "Devices"
msgstr "裝置"

msgid "Health checks"
msgstr "健康檢查"

msgid "Route list ID"
msgstr "路由清單 ID"

msgid "Use 1–32 lowercase Latin letters, digits, or hyphens; start with a letter."
msgstr "使用 1–32 個小寫拉丁字母、數字或連字號，並以字母開頭。"

msgid "Selection mode"
msgstr "選擇模式"

msgid "Best available"
msgstr "最佳可用節點"

msgid "Priority / reserve"
msgstr "優先順序／備援"

msgid "Selected locations in order"
msgstr "依序選擇的位置"

msgid "Examples: country:CA, region:europe, city:CA:Toronto. In priority mode, order is used for reserve selection."
msgstr "範例：country:CA、region:europe、city:CA:Toronto。優先順序模式依此順序選擇備援節點。"

msgid "Client IP addresses or subnets"
msgstr "用戶端 IP 位址或子網路"

msgid "Examples: 192.168.1.20/32 for one device, 192.168.1.0/24 for a subnet. Leave empty for the default list. Give devices fixed DHCP leases so the mapping remains stable."
msgstr "範例：192.168.1.20/32 表示一台裝置，192.168.1.0/24 表示一個子網路。預設清單留空。請為裝置設定靜態 DHCP 租約以保持對應穩定。"

msgid "Active liveness (seconds)"
msgstr "作用中節點存活檢查（秒）"

msgid "Failure retry (seconds)"
msgstr "失敗後重試間隔（秒）"

msgid "All-down recovery (seconds)"
msgstr "全部故障時的復原檢查（秒）"

