msgstr "直連 WAN"

msgid "Domains without proxy"
msgstr "不經過代理的網域"

msgid "Enter a lowercase domain, for example example.com. Use Punycode for Cyrillic names."
msgstr "輸入小寫網域，例如 example.com。非拉丁網域請使用 Punycode。"

msgid "IP addresses and networks without proxy"
msgstr "不經過代理的 IP 位址和網段"

msgid "Detected BitTorrent through WAN"
msgstr "已識別的 BitTorrent 透過 WAN"

msgid "Encrypted or obfuscated P2P traffic may not be recognized by Xray."
msgstr "Xray 可能無法識別加密或混淆的 P2P 流量。"

msgid "Domains .ru and .рф through WAN"
msgstr ".ru 和 .рф 網域透過 WAN"

