msgstr "因速度而切換時，HTTPS 延遲最多可增加 50 毫秒。"

msgid "Switch cooldown (seconds)"
msgstr "切換冷卻時間（秒）"

msgid "Reusable rule groups"
msgstr "可重複使用的規則群組"

msgid "Create a group here, then select it in a route list. Group order within a route list determines precedence."
msgstr "先在此建立規則群組，再於路由清單中選用。群組在清單中的順序決定優先順序。"

msgid "Rule ID"
msgstr "規則 ID"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "動作"

msgid "Proxy through this route list"
msgstr "透過此路由清單代理"

msgid "Domains — one per line"
msgstr "網域，每行一個"

msgid "IP networks — one per line"
msgstr "IP 網段，每行一個"

msgid "At least one domain or IP network is required. Domain and IP matches are alternatives, not a combined condition."
msgstr "至少填寫一個網域或 IP 網段。網域和 IP 任一符合即可，無須同時滿足。"

msgid "Routing rules"
msgstr "路由規則"

msgid "Rule groups in priority order"
msgstr "依優先順序排列的規則群組"

msgid "The first matching group decides the route. Select groups created under Rule databases."
msgstr "首個符合條件的群組決定路由。請選擇在「規則資料庫」中建立的群組。"

msgid "Add at least one domain or IP network."
msgstr "至少新增一個網域或 IP 網段。"

msgid "Only country data selected by route lists is stored and loaded. Routine updates do not restart Xray."
msgstr "僅儲存並載入路由清單選用的國家資料。例行更新不會重新啟動 Xray。"

msgid "Update rules"
msgstr "更新規則"

msgid "Create a group here, then select it in a route list. Each group can combine custom domains, IP networks and one country. Domain and IP matches are alternatives."
msgstr "先在此建立群組，再於路由清單中選用。每組可組合自訂網域、IP 網段和一個國家。網域和 IP 任一符合即可。"

msgid "Add domains, IP networks or a country with a Geo mode."
msgstr "新增網域、IP 網段或含 Geo 模式的國家。"

msgid "Country"
msgstr "國家"

msgid "No country"
msgstr "不選國家"

msgid "Russia (RU)"
msgstr "俄羅斯（RU）"

msgid "China (CN)"
msgstr "中國（CN）"

msgid "Iran (IR)"
msgstr "伊朗（IR）"

msgid "Country data"
msgstr "國家資料"

msgid "GeoSite — domains"
msgstr "GeoSite — 網域"

msgid "GeoIP — IP networks"
msgstr "GeoIP — IP 網段"

msgid "GeoSite and GeoIP"
msgstr "GeoSite 和 GeoIP"

msgid "GeoSite matches domains; GeoIP matches destination IP addresses. They can be used together. The selected data is fetched after Apply; until it is ready, custom entries continue to work."
msgstr "GeoSite 比對網域，GeoIP 比對目的 IP，可同時使用。所選資料在套用後下載；準備完成前，自訂項目仍可使用。"

msgid "Optional. Add a country above to use GeoSite, GeoIP or both."
msgstr "選用。先在上方選擇國家，再使用 GeoSite、GeoIP 或兩者。"

msgid "Additional domain lists"
msgstr "附加網域清單"

msgid "Optional reviewed lists; currently the catalog contains Russian services. These update without restarting Xray."
msgstr "選用的已審核清單；目前目錄包含俄羅斯服務。更新不會重新啟動 Xray。"

msgid "Ready-made rules"
msgstr "預設規則"

msgid "Available presets"
msgstr "可用預設"

msgid "Other country — custom rules"
msgstr "其他國家 — 自訂規則"

msgid "Custom rules"
msgstr "自訂規則"

msgid "For another country, create your own domain and IP rules in “Advanced rule groups”, then add the group to a route list."
